flowchart LR
 Backup[Encrypted Backup / PITR] --> Validate[Scheduled Restore Validation]
 Incident[Regional/Critical Failure] --> Declare[Declare DR]
 Declare --> Plan[Dependency-Ordered DR Plan]
 Plan --> Restore[Restore / Failover]
 Restore --> Verify[Integrity / Tenant / Security / Reconciliation]
 Verify --> Service[Restore Service]
 Service --> Monitor[Heightened Monitoring]
 Monitor --> RCA[Post-Incident / Corrective Actions]
